  {
   "Id": "278618060",
   "Title": null,
   "ReviewText": "This set was an excellent value and choice.  The drill and driver are excellent, the batteries are more than up to the task, a real workhorse for the bulk of the M18 line of tools. Regarding the M18 inflator, it could possibly be the single most useful tool purchased in recent history.  If you are like me, I am always having to air up something. My previous course of action was to drag a small 40 pound compressor, an extension cord for power, and a air hose (don't forget the quick change air chuck!). This inflator makes that process a 5-10 pound, effortless task of airing up various tires.  I am hoping the quality and longevity of the M18 inflator stands the test of time as most of my Milwaukee tools have in the the past!",
   "Rating": 5,
   "RatingRange": 5,
