  {
   "Id": "276242881",
   "Title": null,
   "ReviewText": "We have used these tools for several years at work (electric utility) where they take a beating and keep on working. \r\nI finally bought 5 tools and batteries for home use. Couldn't be happier.  Even with the 5 amp hr batteries they are well balanced and not too heavy.\r\nMy only complaint is the insane and confusing amount of kits and combo kits. The kits have tools you may not want and also may not include one or two you would like. I had to buy mine a-la-cart to get exactly the tools I wanted. That can get expensive. They should offer discounts for say....any five or six tools and be able to build your own custom kit.",
